    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Tamoxifen: agonist in bone + uterus (⇡uterine bleed, ⇡endometrial CA), antagonist in breast (⇣breast CA); ⍉used clinically for bone loss prev (neutral to slight benefit); ⇡hot flashes + VTE risk"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": {
      "rule": "auto",
      "value": 1
     },
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "-",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ospemifene: improves GSM but ⍉bone; ⇡hot flashes; ⍉ ⇡endometrial hyperplasia or CA thru 52 wks (⍉progestogen needed; limited endometrial data beyond 1 yr); neutral effect on breast CA risk; carries SERM class VTE warning"
     }
    ]
   },
